{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Furnish your Train</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip your train car with seats, a snack machine, a bar or even a music corner! Trains don\u2019t have to be boring and your passengers will demand the most fun ride they can get!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679560/extras/large_train_editor.gif?t=1748532925\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Manage Passengers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move your passengers so everyone is happy. Happy passengers will give a gracious tip. Use the money to travel to next stops and buy new modules for your train!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679560/extras/large_passenger_swap.gif?t=1748532925\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Buy and Unlock Modules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your train at each stop making it more accommodating for passengers. The shop lets you purchase new modules from the money you received. Finishing a run will unlock new modules you can use to complete harder routes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679560/extras/banner_shop.gif?t=1748532925\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Travel Europe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the playtest, you\u2019ll be travelling our home region of Bavaria. However, the final game will include much of Europe. Maybe you\u2019ll even find a cool town for your next holiday!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679560/extras/large_train_showcase.gif?t=1748532925\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Join Discord</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Train Jumble is still in active development! So we're always looking for feedback &amp; ideas! Join our Discord server to discuss the game and hang out!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3679560?t=1748532925","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3679560?t=1748532925","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679560/936e9b792a7560516add7a874456db48649104a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748532925","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679560/936e9b792a7560516add7a874456db48649104a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748532925","categories":[{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Furnish your Train</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip your train car with seats, a snack machine, a bar or even a music corner! Trains don\u2019t have to be boring and your passengers will demand the most fun ride they can get!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679560/extras/large_train_editor.gif?t=1748532925\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Manage Passengers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move your passengers so everyone is happy. Happy passengers will give a gracious tip. Use the money to travel to next stops and buy new modules for your train!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679560/extras/large_passenger_swap.gif?t=1748532925\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Buy and Unlock Modules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your train at each stop making it more accommodating for passengers. The shop lets you purchase new modules from the money you received. Finishing a run will unlock new modules you can use to complete harder routes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679560/extras/banner_shop.gif?t=1748532925\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Travel Europe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the playtest, you\u2019ll be travelling our home region of Bavaria. However, the final game will include much of Europe. Maybe you\u2019ll even find a cool town for your next holiday!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679560/extras/large_train_showcase.gif?t=1748532925\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Join Discord</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Train Jumble is still in active development! So we're always looking for feedback &amp; ideas! Join our Discord server to discuss the game and hang out!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Emergo Entertainment"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3411360","name":"Train Jumble"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679560/58df949207e7512fa494dc480a540e0d726cdf05/header.jpg?t=1748532925","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257139022,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139022/movie480.mp4?t=1748262008","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139022/movie_max.mp4?t=1748262008"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257139022/baccfe08424350d3fb985d7554632f3eea7f0a62/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748262008","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139022/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748262008","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139022/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748262008"}}],"name":"Train Jumble Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><stron